# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> (quality of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> "a relation between a quality and an independent continuant (the bearer), in which the quality specifically depends on the bearer for its existence"@en)
