TransitiveObjectProperty(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002230>)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> (has start location)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> "x 'has starts location' y if and only if there exists some process z such that x 'starts with' z and z 'occurs in' y")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/subsets#ro-eco>)
