# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002256> (developmentally induced by)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002256> "t1 induced_by t2 if there is a process of developmental induction (GO:0031128) with t1 and t2 as interacting participants. t2 causes t1 to change its fate from a precursor material anatomical entity type T to T', where T' develops_from T")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002256> "developmentally induced by"@en)
