AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002285> "x developmentally replaces y if and only if there is some developmental process that causes x to move or to cease to exist, and for the site that was occupied by x to become occupied by y, where y either comes into existence in this site or moves to this site from somewhere else")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002285> "developmentally replaces"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002285> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002258>)

