AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002339> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_gocam>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002339> "has target end location"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002339> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002344>)

