AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002341> "Holds between p and l when p is a transportation or localization process and the outcome of this process is to move c from one location to another, and the route taken by c follows a path that is aligned_with l ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002341> "results in transport along"@en)
