# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0014028> (notochord formation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:dh") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:ef") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0014028> "The formation of the notochord from the chordamesoderm. The notochord is composed of large cells packed within a firm connective tissue sheath and is found in all chordates at the ventral surface of the neural tube. In vertebrates, the notochord contributes to the vertebral column.")
