AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:aruk") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:bc") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:14980203") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16144764") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16547515") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18685038") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27788368") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:9459440") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0150098> "Cell-cell signaling that mediates the transfer of information from a glial cell to a neuron. This signaling has been shown to be mediated by various molecules, depending on which glial cells release them, and in which tissues the signaling occurs, e.g. microglial cell-derived nerve growth factor (NGF) in the retina, or microglial cell-derived superoxide ions in the cerebellum.")
